# ── MARK LV — what never belongs in the repository ──────────────────────────
# Everything listed here is created by the app on first run. A fresh clone with
# none of it present boots straight to the setup screen, which is the intended
# first experience — so nothing here needs to be committed, and some of it must
# never be.
#
# Comments go on their OWN line: git has no end-of-line comments, so
# "file   # note" is read as a pattern that matches nothing.

# ── Secrets. Committing any of these publishes them. ──────────────────────────
# your Gemini API key, plus per-plugin credentials
config/api_keys.json
# the dashboard's TLS private key and certificate
config/certs/
# a LINKED WhatsApp session — committing it hands somebody your WhatsApp
# account, not just a key
config/whatsapp_web/
# Google OAuth tokens and client secrets (Gmail / Calendar plugins)
**/token*.json
**/client_secret*.json
*credentials*.json
.env
.env.*

# ── Personal data the assistant accumulates about you ─────────────────────────
memory/long_term.json
memory/*.db
# your face embedding (presence)
config/owner_face.npy
# devices seen on your home network
config/known_devices.json
# your personal protocols
config/protocols.json

# ── Downloaded / generated assets ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# face models (~37 MB, fetched on first enrolment)
config/models/
# synthesised sound effects
config/sfx/

# ── Python build noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/

# ── Virtual environments ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# ── Editors and operating systems ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Runtime output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/
/downloads/
# root-anchored: the app's runtime captures, not docs/screenshots/
/screenshots/
# terminal command channel: port + per-launch token (deleted on exit)
config/cli.json
